        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2008, Solid Brass R-Series Towel Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic styling of Deltana's bathroom towel ring means it will look good amongst traditional decor. It is large enough for the thickest full-sized towels but not so bulky that hand towels would look out of place hanging from it. Crafted out of solid brass, the R-Series Towel Ring features concealed screw mounting for a chic look. It is available in beautiful and timeless finishes. This bathroom towel ring is made with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2008-specifications.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"397\" height=\"262\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2008 Towel Ring Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R-Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R Series Bathroom or Kitchen Towel Ring:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Ring Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2008.pdf?v=1704262290\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2008 Towel Ring Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel ring, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
