                "description": "Deltana R2008 Solid Brass R-Series Towel Ring - The classic styling of Deltana's bathroom towel ring means it will look good amongst traditional decor. It is large enough for the thickest full-sized towels but not so bulky that hand towels would look out of place hanging from it. Crafted out of solid brass, the R-Series Towel Ring features concealed screw mounting for a chic look. It is available in beautiful and timeless finishes. This bathroom towel ring is made with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for.",
